48/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は今日まで秋田に帰ってました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日\n大好きな校舎 教室 お友達 先生 制服と\nお別れをしてきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とても感慨深い気持ちになりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつものように\n私を笑顔で迎えてくれた先生"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少し会っていない間に\n輝きを増していたお友達"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなが\n楽しそうに授業を受ける姿を見て\n正直羨ましく思いました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"優しいお友達は\n後戻りしそうな私の背中を\nいってらっしゃいと押してくれました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵なお友達と出会い\n共に学べたことは私の財産。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5月\n気持ち新たに頑張ります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくお願い致します。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鈴木絢音"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-11270":{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/01/2386553/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/01/2386553/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は握手会がありましたー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/01/2386553/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"《13日の金曜日》の服で出ましたー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/01/2386553/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/01/2386553/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めましての方、久しぶりに会えた方、いつも来てくれる方、女の子♪\n手をふってくれた方も〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/01/2386553/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しんでもらえてたら嬉しいーなー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやはスッゴク楽しかった〜！\nありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/01/2386553/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お留守番の方も応援ありがとうございます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、初コメさんや、お久し振りのコメさん、他推しのコメさんもいてくれて嬉しいです♪\nありがとうございます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろんいつもコメしてくださる方..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/01/2386553/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"温かいコメントありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/01/2386553/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/01/2386553/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/01/2386553/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみん(高山かずみちゃん)と(生田えりかちゃん)と(川後ひなちゃん)に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやらしい服って言ってもらえた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/01/2386553/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うれしー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/01/2386553/0010.gif","alt":